flowchart LR
  USER[Local seller or evaluator] --> CONSOLE[Vinext operational console]
  USER --> CLI[CLI]
  CONSOLE --> API[Loopback Python API]
  API --> WORKER[LangGraph application worker]
  CLI --> WORKER
  WORKER --> DB[(SQLite prototype store)]
  WORKER --> GATEWAY[Private LiteLLM proxy]
  GATEWAY --> EXTRACT[Extraction model]
  GATEWAY --> STRATEGY[Risk and synthesis model]

  DATA[Synthetic Salesforce, Gong, pricing, policy, Slack files] --> WORKER
  SECRET[Environment or secret manager] --> GATEWAY
  WORKER --> ARTIFACTS[Protected run artifacts]
  WORKER --> TELEMETRY[Trace and model invocation records]

  DB -. production replacement .-> PG[(Highly available PostgreSQL)]
  DB -. production replacement .-> SEARCH[Managed hybrid evidence search]
  WORKER -. production replacement .-> QUEUE[Durable worker queue]
  TELEMETRY -. production replacement .-> OTEL[OpenTelemetry backend]
